{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Vanessa and the Rude Customer", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Dealing With Customers", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Food for Thought > Folklore on Food", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 5, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use important information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Being Persuasive", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you work in a restaurant or a shop, it is important to be persuasive to be able to change a customer's mind about something.<br><br>Remember to be polite and use appropriate expressions to persuade someone.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use expressions like <span class=\"italic\"> Don't you think ... ?</span> or <span class=\"italic\">Don't you agree ... ?</span> to convince or persuade someone to change their minds.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use modals like <span class=\"italic\">should</span>, <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span> or <span class=\"italic\">would rather</span> to suggest what is necessary. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: I'm sorry I lost my temper yesterday. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: It's OK, but a good customer is good for business, don't you think? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Yes, I would rather serve a happy client.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: You should remember the magic words: Service with a smile! Don't you agree?", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Offering Advice and Solutions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you work in a restaurant or in a shop, it is important to offer advice and solutions properly.<br><br>Remember to offer advice politely and to use the modals  <span class=\"italic\">could</span>,  <span class=\"italic\">should</span> or  <span class=\"italic\">might</span> to propose a solution.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Here is a list of expressions you can use to offer advice and solutions:<ul><li>You might want to ... </li> <li>Would you mind ... ?</li> <li>You should ... </li> <li>You ought to ... (strong request)</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: What should I do next time? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: You should remain calm. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "out of line ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "inappropriate; unacceptable ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The customer's behavior was out of line yesterday.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use in a conversation about a difficult person.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "reputation  ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "widespread opinion about something or someone ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Our restaurant's reputation depends on our good customer service.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to lose one's temper ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to become nervous and angry  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm sorry I lost my temper yesterday.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to lose someone's business ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to not have customers because of a problem  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We may have lost his business, unfortunately.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "persuasive ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "able to persuade and convince others ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: A free meal can be very persuasive!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "service industry ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "business that provides services or specialized work for customers ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We work in the service industry and we ought to treat our clients with care.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Role-play a situation with your partner. Choose one of the roles below. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Student A Role\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Student B Role\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" You want to eat at a restaurant but cannot decide on a place. You eventually change your mind after your partner persuades you to follow their advice.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You provide advice and solutions to your partner. You persuade your partner to change their minds about where you want to eat.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Write a dialogue (12 to 14 lines) about the situation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the dialogue aloud.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content":