, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn6le05ob05re2img07.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sarah, I would like to go over what happened yesterday with you.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sarah</span>: I'm sorry I sounded rude to the customer. It won't happen again.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It's not your fault, don't worry. His behaviour was out of line. However, we work in the service industry, and we ought to treat our clients with the appropriate care. Our reputation depends on it.", "id": 1, "time": "0", "image": "engenn6le05ob05re2img07.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sarah</span>: What should I do next time?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You should remain calm and keep your cool. Try to change the tone of your voice.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sarah</span>: He started shouting first! I lost my temper after that.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I know, but he felt like you were ordering him to turn his phone off. I think that a suggestion would work better than a request, don't you agree?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sarah</span>: Yes, I would rather serve a happy client. I didn't get a tip yesterday.", "id": 2, "time": "19500", "image": "engenn6le05ob05re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: We may have lost his business, unfortunately. Let's hope he doesn't give us a bad review. We really want to avoid that. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sarah</span>: How? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Free meals are quite persuasive ...", "id": 3, "time": "45500", "image": "engenn6le05ob05re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le05ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le05ob05re2img07.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}